[0.110, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[39m \u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/manifest/docs/small-trader-and-docking-plan.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line, removed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 119 \u001b[22m curve that rises steeply with the acceleration, so a very hard burn is punishingly expensive but can\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 120 \u001b[22m win a race, such as to colonise a new system, and with the mass of everything aboard: hull, fuel\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 121 \u001b[22m tanks and their fuel, occupants and passengers, and cargo. The tanks are apart from the cargo hold\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 122 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mand grow on the tech tree. A slow run coasts between its burns; a station refuels a ship automatically\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m     -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m, as it connects its life support, while                                                              \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 122 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mand grow on the tech tree. A slow run coasts between its burns\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m, the player choosing the share of the c\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[48;2;4;71;0mruise's time the engines thrust as a percentage, and the acceleration in g up to what the ship can do\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m;\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m a station refuels a ship automatically, as it connects its life support, while                       \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[2m 123 \u001b[22m its owner allows\u001b[29Git\u001b[32Gand\u001b[36Gits\u001b[40Gfunds\u001b[46Glast;\u001b[52Gand\u001b[56Ga\u001b[58Gstanding\u001b[67Gpolicy\u001b[74Gpicks\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Gburn\u001b[89Gthat\u001b[94Gmakes\u001b[100Gthe\u001b[104Gmost\u001b[109Gan\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 124 \u001b[12G\u001b[22mhour\u001b[17Gunless\u001b[24Gits\u001b[28Gowner\u001b[34Gfixes\u001b[40Gone\u001b[44G(the\u001b[49Guser's,\u001b[57Gas\u001b[60GW21\u001b[64Gwas\u001b[68Gplanned).\u001b[78GThe\u001b[82Gmechanism\u001b[92Gand\u001b[96Gits\u001b[100Gnumbers\u001b[108Gare\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 125 \u001b[22m the [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mW21 plan\u001b[39m](stage-4-trading-plan.md#w21-plan).\u001b[K\r\u001b[10C\u001b[2B\u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell co\u001b[22Gmand…\u001b[K\r\u001b[13C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m2m 53s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m17.0k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[7B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
