[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1417 \u001b[22m   times a km/s at 1 g, 4 g 16 times and 12 g 144 times: a hard burn empties the tanks far faster and\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 1418 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  can be punishingly expensive, yet worth it to win a race, such as to colonise a new system. \u001b[48;2;92;2;0mExact\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 1419 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  in integers, the factor an integer power. The mass is everything aboard as the leg starts: the     \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m18\u001b[15G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mcan b\u001b[21G punishingly\u001b[34Gexpensive, yet worth it to win\u001b[65Ga rac\u001b[71G, such as to colonis\u001b[93Ga new system. \u001b[48;2;4;71;0mEach\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 1419 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  phase's speed change is its acceleration times its seconds from `CruiseThrust`, the factor an      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1420 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  integer power, the kilograms rounded up. The mass is everything aboard as the leg starts: the      \r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m1\u001b[15G\u001b[22mhull's `mass`, i\u001b[33G fuel\u001b[39Gtanks' (`fu\u001b[51Gl.tankTonne\u001b[63GPerTonne`, 0.25 t of tank to each tonne of\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1422 \u001b[15G\u001b[22mcapacity),\u001b[26Gthe\u001b[30Gfuel\u001b[35Gin\u001b[38Gthem,\u001b[44Gits\u001b[48Goccupants\u001b[58Gand\u001b[62Gpassengers\u001b[73G(`fuel.occupantKilograms`,\u001b[100G100\u001b[104Geach,\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 1423 \u001b[22m   with their \u001b[27Gffects) and its cargo, each tote\u001b[60Gits\u001b[64Gunits\u001b[70Gtimes\u001b[76Gthe\u001b[80Gitem's\u001b[87Gdensity\u001b[95Gover\u001b[100Gits\u001b[104Gunits\u001b[110Gper\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[