;248;242m  integer power, the kilograms rounded up. The mass is everything aboard as the leg starts: the      \r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m1\u001b[15G\u001b[22mhull's `mass`, i\u001b[33G fuel\u001b[39Gtanks' (`fu\u001b[51Gl.tankTonne\u001b[63GPerTonne`, 0.25 t of tank to each tonne of\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1422 \u001b[15G\u001b[22mcapacity),\u001b[26Gthe\u001b[30Gfuel\u001b[35Gin\u001b[38Gthem,\u001b[44Gits\u001b[48Goccupants\u001b[58Gand\u001b[62Gpassengers\u001b[73G(`fuel.occupantKilograms`,\u001b[100G100\u001b[104Geach,\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 1423 \u001b[22m   with their \u001b[27Gffects) and its cargo, each tote\u001b[60Gits\u001b[64Gunits\u001b[70Gtimes\u001b[76Gthe\u001b[80Gitem's\u001b[87Gdensity\u001b[95Gover\u001b[100Gits\u001b[104Gunits\u001b[110Gper\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/manif\u001b[27Gst/docs/stage-4-trading-plan.md)\u001b[60G\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m3\u001b[14G\u001b[22mlines,\u001b[21Gr\u001b[23Gmoved \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m line\u001b[37G\u001b[K\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m3\u001b[15G\u001b[22mwith thei\u001b[25G effects)\u001b[35Gand its cargo\u001b[50Geach tote its\u001b[64Gunits times the item'\u001b[86G density over its units\u001b[110Gper\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m1424\u001b[13G\u001b[22m \u001b[15Gcubic\u001b[21Gmetre\u001b[27G(copper's\u001b[37G0.95\u001b[42Gt),\u001b[46Go\u001b[75Gluded.\u001b[82GThe\u001b[86Gfuel's\u001b[93Gmass\u001b[98Gcounts\u001b[105Gat\u001b[108Gthe\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
