[0.030, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m6\u001b[15G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242munmanned at 12 g, 1.34 days and 13,653 km/s. A local\u001b[68Gtrip\u001b[73Gacross\u001b[80Ga\u001b[82Gplanet's\u001b[91Gorbit,\u001b[98G42,000\u001b[105Gkm,\u001b[109Gon\u001b[112Gth\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m    \u001b[13G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242me\u001b[15G     \u001b[21G           \u001b[33G   \u001b[37G         \u001b[47G      \u001b[54G     \u001b[60G     \u001b[66G   \u001b[70G      \u001b[77G  \u001b[80G \u001b[82G          \u001b[93G      \u001b[100G   \u001b[104G   \r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m7\u001b[15G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mboost: under\u001b[29Gn\u001b[31Ghour \u001b[37Gt 100%, 1.2 hours at 25%. \u001b[64G  \u001b[67G     \u001b[73G   \u001b[77G   \u001b[81G    \u001b[86G       \u001b[94G   \u001b[98G   \u001b[102G   \u001b[106G  \u001b[109G    \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m08\u001b[13G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m-\u001b[15G**The controls.** The\u001b[37Ggraphical cli\u001b[51Gnt\u001b[54G(L15) shows\u001b[66Gthe thru\u001b[75Gt as\u001b[81G percentage slider\u001b[100Gand the\u001b[108G   \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m09\u001b[15G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242macc\u001b[19Gleration\u001b[28Gas a separate\u001b[42Gcontro\u001b[49G in g, bounded as ab\u001b[70Gve for the ship chosen.\u001b[94GThe\u001b[98GTUI\u001b[102Gmay\u001b[106Gbe\u001b[109Gmore\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m0\u001b[15G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mbasic: the two v\u001b[33Gues shown as numbers and stepped\u001b[66Gwit\u001b[71Gkeys (5%\u001b[80Gand 0.1 g a press),\u001b[100Gheld\u001b[105Gto\u001b[108Gthe\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m1\u001b[15G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242ms\u001b[17Gme bounds. The console's `\u001b[44Gravel` takes them as two\u001b[69Goptional\u001b[78Goperands,\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1412 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  `travel [principal] <ship> <venue> [thrust%] [g]`. Each converts to `thrustBps` and                \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1413 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  `accelerationMilliG`, which the server checks against the ship again.                              \r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m4\u001b[13G\u001b[22m-\u001b[15G**Fuel burned, on a\u001b[35Gcurve.** Each phase of a leg burns\u001b[70G`fuel.kilogramsPerTonneKms` (0.005) times\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1415 \u001b[15G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[19Gship's\u001b[26Gmass\u001b[31Gin\u001b[34Gtonnes\u001b[41Gtimes\u001b[47Gthe\u001b[51Gphase's\u001b[59Gspeed\u001b[65Gchange\u001b[72Gin\u001b[75Gkm/s,\u001b[81Gtimes\u001b[87Gthe\u001b[91Gacceleration's\u001b[106Gfactor:\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 1416 \u001b[22m   1 up to 1 g and the accelera\u001b[44Gion in g squared\u001b[61Gabove\u001b[67Git\u001b[70G(`fuel.curveExponent`,\u001b[93G2),\u001b[97Gso\u001b[100G2\u001b[102Gg\u001b[104Gcosts\u001b[110G4\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/project\u001b[20G/manifest/docs/stage-4-trading-\u001b[52Gl\u001b[54Gn.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m3\u001b[14G\u001b[22mlines, removed \u001b[1m2\u001b[31G\u001b[22mlines\u001b[K\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m5\u001b[16G\u001b[22mhe \u001b[20Ghip's mass\u001b[31Gin tonnes times the phase's speed change in km/s,\u001b[81Gtimes the acceleration's factor:\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1416 \u001b[22m   1 up to 1 g and the acceleration in g squared above it (`fuel.curveExponent`, 2), so 2 g costs 4\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1417 \u001b[22m   times a km/s at 1 g, 4 g 16 times and 12 g 144 times: a hard burn empties the tanks far faster and\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 1418 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  can be punishingly expensive, yet worth it to win a race, such as to colonise a new system. \u001b[48;2;92;2;0mExact\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m  \r\u001b[5C\u