[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 351 \u001b[22m rails, so where the target will be on arrival is solved rather than chased: the time gives the\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m2\u001b[12G\u001b[22mt\u001b[14Grget'\u001b[20G place,\u001b[32Gcourse\u001b[39Gto it gives the time again, in eight rounds, which the fourth root\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m3\u001b[12G\u001b[22msettles we\u001b[23Gl within. The course is a few straight legs\u001b[67Ground the star\u001b[84Gplanets and moons in the\u001b[109Gway\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning\u001b[11Gthe\u001b[15Gformat\u001b[22Gcheck\u001b[28Gand\u001b[32Gdeclaration\u001b[44Gspacing,\u001b[53Gthen\u001b[58Gcommitting\u001b[69Gand\u001b[73Gstarting\u001b[82Gthe\u001b[86Ggate.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning\u001b[11Gls\u001b[14Gscripts\u001b[22G|\u001b[24Ggrep\u001b[29G-i\u001b[32Gformat;\u001b[40G./scripts/format-che…\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m ⎿  $ ls scripts | grep -i format; ./scripts/format-check.sh 2>&1 | tail -5\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
