[0.119, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H     \u001b[2m 345 \u001b[12G\u001b[22mprofile in its place (`Space::CruiseProfile`),\u001b[59Gfor\u001b[63Ga\u001b[65Ggame\u001b[70Gplayed\u001b[77Gover\u001b[82Gdays:\u001b[88Ga\u001b[90Gboost\u001b[96Gacceleration\u001b[109Gfor\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m6\u001b[12G\u001b[22mat most a tim\u001b[26G over the\u001b[36Gwhole cruise,\u001b[50Ghalf at each end, and \u001b[73G sustained o\u001b[86Ge between, turning at the\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 347 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mmidpoint, the time its closed form. The bodies are on                                                 \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 347 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mmidpoint, the time its closed form. A profile may thrust for only a share of the cruise's time        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 348 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m(`thrustShare`), half at each end, and coast between at the speed it reached: a share rather than     \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m9\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mseconds, so it means the same\u001b[42Gat any distanc\u001b[57G, \u001b[60Gnd `CruiseThrust`\u001b[78Ggives \u001b[85Gach\u001b[89Gend's seconds at the\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m50\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mboost and th\u001b[25G sust\u001b[31Gined rate,\u001b[42Gwhich a game prices its fuel from. The\u001b[81Gbodies are\u001b[92Gon   \u001b[98G      \u001b[105G    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 351 \u001b[22m rails, so where the target will be on arrival is solved rather than chased: the time gives the\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 352 \u001b[22m target's place, the course to it gives the time again, in eight rounds, which the fourth root\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m3\u001b[12G\u001b[22msettles well within. The course\u001b[44Gis\u001b[47Ga few straight legs round the stars, planets\u001b[92Gand moons in the\u001b[109Gway\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning the format check\u001b[28Gand\u001b[32Gdeclaration\u001b[44Gspacing,\u001b[53Gthen\u001b[58Gcommitting\u001b[69Gand\u001b[73Gstarting\u001b[82Gthe\u001b[86Ggate.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mDeclaration spacing is clean\u001b[32Gin\u001b[35Gmy\u001b[38Gfiles;\u001b[45Gthe\u001b[49Gtwo\u001b[53G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mnet\u001b[57G\u001b[39mfiles\u001b[63Gflagged\u001b[71Gwere\u001b[76Galready\u001b[84Glike\u001b[89Gthat\u001b[94Gbefore\u001b[101Gthis\u001b[106Gchange.\r\u001b[1B  Committing and starting the gate.\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
