[0.033, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 349 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mseconds, so it means the same at any distance, and `CruiseThrust` gives each end's seconds at the     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 350 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mboost and the sustained rate, which a game prices its fuel from. The bodies are on                    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 351 \u001b[22m rails, so where the target will be on arrival is solved rather than chased: the time gives the\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 352 \u001b[22m target's place, the course to it gives the time again, in eight rounds, which the fourth root\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 353 \u001b[22m settles well within. The course is a few straight legs round the stars, planets and moons in the way\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning the format check\u001b[28Gand\u001b[32Gdeclara\u001b[40Gion spacing, then committing and s\u001b[75Ga\u001b[77Gti\u001b[80Gg the gate.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mDeclaration\u001b[15Gspacing\u001b[23Gis\u001b[26Gclean\u001b[32Gin\u001b[35Gmy\u001b[38Gfiles;\u001b[45Gthe\u001b[49Gtwo\u001b[53G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mnet\u001b[57G\u001b[39mfiles\u001b[63Gflagged\u001b[71Gwere\u001b[76Galready\u001b[84Glike\u001b[89Gthat\u001b[94Gbefore\u001b[101Gthis\u001b[106Gchange.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3GComm\u001b[8Gtting and starting the gate.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  1 action not run · permission denied\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mReason: PreToolUse:Bash hook error: git add -A/--all/. would stage ./asciinema: add the files by name.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[38;2;255;107;128mShellError: Command failed with exit code 1:\r\u001b[14C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m10\u001b[18G 32s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m31.9k toke\u001b[38Gs)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
