[0.091, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 351 \u001b[22m rails, so where the target will be on arrival is solved rather than chased: the time gives the\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 352 \u001b[22m target's place, the course to it gives the time again, in eight rounds, which the fourth root\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m3\u001b[12G\u001b[22msettles well within. The course\u001b[44Gis\u001b[47Ga few straight legs round the stars, planets\u001b[92Gand moons in the\u001b[109Gway\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning the format check\u001b[28Gand\u001b[32Gdeclaration\u001b[44Gspacing,\u001b[53Gthen\u001b[58Gcommitting\u001b[69Gand\u001b[73Gstarting\u001b[82Gthe\u001b[86Ggate.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mDeclaration spacing is\u001b[26Gclean\u001b[32Gin\u001b[35Gmy\u001b[38Gfiles;\u001b[45Gthe\u001b[49Gtwo\u001b[53G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mnet\u001b[57G\u001b[39mfiles\u001b[63Gflagged\u001b[71Gwere\u001b[76Galready\u001b[84Glike\u001b[89Gthat\u001b[94Gbefore\u001b[101Gthis\u001b[106Gchange.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BCommitting\u001b[14Gand\u001b[18Gstarting\u001b[27Gthe\u001b[31Ggate.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m shell commands, did not run \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m other call \r\u001b[1B  ⎿  $ git add -A docs source/engine/space source/samples/space/tests/ModsTests.cpp\r\u001b[1B  ⎿  1 action not run · permission denied\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mReas\u001b[14G: PreToolUse:Bash h\u001b[34Gok \u001b[38Grror: git add -A/--all/. would stage ./asciinema: add the files by name.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m Committed as \u001b[38;2;177;1