at fall out of this\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe thrust slider matters more than now.\u001b[46G\u001b[22mAt\u001b[49Gabout\u001b[55G10%\u001b[59Gof\u001b[62Glight\u001b[68Gspeed,\u001b[75GOre\u001b[79Gto\u001b[82GBrine\u001b[88Gat\u001b[91Gfull\u001b[96Gthrust\u001b[103Gneeds\u001b[109Greaction\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gmass of about 15% of the ship's mass, and 25% thrust needs about 5%. Tank\u001b[79Gsize becomes a real logistic\u001b[109Gchoice, and\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Ba full hold flown\u001b[23Ghard needs bigger tanks.\u001b[76G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
