[0.060, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[7G\u001b[2m1392 \u001b[14G\u001b[22m \"Fusion pellets\", deuterium an\u001b[46G helium-3, `Categ\u001b[65GyFuels`, of th\u001b[80G Space Age, by the\u001b[99Gkilogram: 100\u001b[113Gk\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m      \u001b[22m g\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1393 \u001b[22m   to the cubic metre (a density of 0.2 at a pack factor of 0.5), 12.5 kg a tote, at 1,200 credits a\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m1394 \u001b[14G\u001b[22m kg, a \u001b[22Gote 15,000. Helium-3\u001b[43Gis refined in few places: one\u001b[73Gstation\u001b[81Gof\u001b[84Geach\u001b[89Gplanet\u001b[96Gmakes\u001b[102Gpellets,\u001b[111GOre\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/manifest/source/game/content/tests/ContentTests.cpp)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m1\u001b[14G\u001b[22mline,\u001b[20Gremoved \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m605\u001b[14G\u001b[22m      });\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m606\u001b[14G\u001b[22m};\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 607 \u001b[22m   \u001b[38;2;117;113;94m// A torch's fuels are the ships' (D-108): every station of both scenarios makes reaction mass,\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 608 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  // 10,000 kg a day, its broker seeded with \u001b[48;2;92;2;0mthe warehouse's \u001b[48;2;61;1;0m800 totes, and one station of each       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 608 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  \u001b[38;2;117;113;94m// 10,000 kg a day, its broker seeded with 800 totes, \u001b[48;2;4;71;0mabout nine days, \u001b[48;2;2;40;0mand one station of each\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m      \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m609\u001b[14G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;117;113;94m// planet refines pellets, 2 kg a day; no household wants either.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\