[0.094, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[8G\u001b[2m9\u001b[10G\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;117;113;94m# Coast grows wheat and chickpeas and makes the glassware, soap, wellness goods and medical\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[2m0 \u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;117;113;94m# supplies; its Delta barley and peas; its Saltworks salt and lime. Every station makes reaction mass\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 11 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mfor the ships, 10,000 kg a day, and Ore Deeps and Brine Saltworks refine fusion pellets, 2 kg a day    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 12 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m(D-108). A station makes what its region                                                               \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 13 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m# makes and its essentials' demand is its region's need, which set its prices; a row's region is       \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 11 +\u001b[38;2;117;113;94m\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m# \u001b[48;2;2;40;0mfor the ships, 10,000 kg a day, and Ore Deeps and Brine Saltworks refine fusion pellets, 2 kg a day\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 12 +\u001b[38;2;117;113;94m# (D-108). A station makes what its region makes and its essentials' demand is its region's need, which\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m    +\u001b[38;2;117;113;94m set its prices; a row's region is\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                     \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m13 \u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;117;113;94m# the\u001b[17Gemployer that makes\u001b[37Git,\u001b[41Gand the households that want it when no need names it. M\u001b[98Grket rate\u001b[108G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 14 \u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;117;113;94m# are per simulation day, in the item's unit (docs/model.md); stock is in totes, eight to the IBC\u