ove 1 g. The best\u001b[78Gth\u001b[81Gust share comes out of the\u001b[108Gratio of\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bull-thrust\u001b[17Gfuel\u001b[22Gcost\u001b[27Gto\u001b[30Gthe\u001b[34Grun's\u001b[40Ggross:\u001b[47Gabout\u001b[53G45%\u001b[57Gfor\u001b[61Gcheap\u001b[67Gcargo,\u001b[74G85%\u001b[78Gfor\u001b[82Gdear\u001b[87Gcargo,\u001b[94Gand\u001b[98G100%\u001b[103Gonly\u001b[108Gif\u001b[111Gfuel\u001b[116Gwere\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bfree.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BOn a run gr\u001b[20Gsing 4,590 credits, the starter earns 14\u001b[62Gredits an hour\u001b[77Gat 100% thr\u001b[89Gst, 22\u001b[96Gat\u001b[99G50%\u001b[103Gand\u001b[107G20\u001b[110Gat\u001b[113G25%.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- A 2 g run costs about 13,000 credits, and the starter c\u001b[63Gn\u001b[65Gonly fly it with\u001b[82GFuel Bunkers.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mBigger ships fly dirtier drives,\u001b[22m designed now and booked\u001b[62Gas W22\u001b[69Gfor when\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82Gfirst larger\u001b[95Ghull\u001b[100Gis\u001b[103Gflown:\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BHaul\u001b[12Gr fusion: 0.3 g, must stay 1\u001b[62Gbefore lighting its drive.\u001b[89G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7GPulse drive:\u001b[20G0.5 g, must\u001b[32Gstay\u001b[37G100,000\u001b[45Gkm\u001b[48Gfrom\u001b[53Gstations\u001b[62Gand\u001b[66Ginhabited\u001b[76Gplanets;\u001b[85Gits\u001b[89Gfuel\u001b[94Gis\u001b[97Gmade\u001b[102Gonly\u001b[107Gunder\u001b[113Ga\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7Ggovernment's lic\u001b[24Gnce.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BShips cross those radi\u001b[30G on manoeuvring\u001b[46Gt\u001b[76Gtug.\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
