[0.789, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 1531 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   `company`). Two commits. **The burn done** 2026-11-22: `Travel` version 2, its profile, the       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1532 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   console's operands and the leg's fuel taken as it starts, `InsufficientFuel`; a power-law ship    \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 1533 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   burns none, so two pins moved by the request's two new fields alone. Refuelling next, on an       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1534 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   immediate buy through the venue's book that `trade` gives `company`.                              \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 1535 \u001b[22m 4. The pol\u001b[24Gcy: the lot's charge, the estimate at a\u001b[64Gburn\u001b[69Gand\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77Gchoice\u001b[84Gper\u001b[88Ghour,\u001b[94Ga\u001b[96Gfixed\u001b[102Gshare\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 1536 \u001b[22m \u001b[14G  (`policy`),\u001b[28Gthe pins\u001b[37Gmoved\u001b[43Gand\u001b[47Gwhy.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m15\u001b[10G7 \u001b[13G\u001b[22m5.\u001b[16GThe fixture, on\u001b[32Gthe man\u001b[40Ged profile:\u001b[52GOre\u001b[56Gto\u001b[59GBrine\u001b[65Gwith\u001b[70Gtwo\u001b[74Gtotes\u001b[80Gof\u001b[83Gcopper\u001b[90Gand\u001b[94Gwith\u001b[99Ga\u001b[101Gfull\u001b[106Ghold,\u001b[112Gth\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[11G \u001b[13G\u001b[22me\u001b[16G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mBefore writing \"the request's two new fields alone\" in the plan, I'll check it: drop the two fields' registration\u001b[117Gfor\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Ba\u001b[5Gmoment and see whether the old fixture hash comes back.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file \u001b[39