[0.327, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1435 \u001b[22m   `accelerationMilliG`, which the server checks against the ship again.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1436 \u001b[22m - **Fuel burned.** Each phase of a leg burns reaction mass, 0.0334 kg, and pellets, 16.5 mg times\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/manifest/docs/stage-4-trading-plan.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m lines, removed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m28\u001b[13G\u001b[22m3.\u001b[16GThe burn: `Travel`'\u001b[37G`thrustBps` and\u001b[53G`accelerationMilliG`,\u001b[75Gthe\u001b[79Gprofile\u001b[87Gfor\u001b[91Gthem,\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Gconsole's\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m29\u001b[13G\u001b[22m  \u001b[16Gop\u001b[19Grands and\u001b[29Gthe TUI's step\u001b[44Ged controls, reaction mass and pellets\u001b[83Gburn\u001b[88Gd\u001b[90Gby mass and speed change\r\u001b[12C\u001b[1B,\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1530 \u001b[16G\u001b[22m`InsufficientFuel`;\u001b[36Grefuelling\u001b[47Gand\u001b[51G`SetRefuel`,\u001b[64Gthe\u001b[68Gaccount\u001b[76Gshort\u001b[82Gand\u001b[86Gthe\u001b[90Gflag\u001b[95Goff\u001b[99G(`travel`,\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 1531 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   `company`).                                                                                       \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 1531 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   `company`). Two commits. **The burn done** 2026-11-22: `Travel` version 2, its profile, the       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1532 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   console's operands and the leg's fuel taken as it starts, `InsufficientFuel`; a power-law ship    \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 1533 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   burns none, so two pins moved by the request's two new fields alone. Refuelling next, on an       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1534 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   immediate buy through the venue's book that `trade` gives `company`.                              \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 1535 \u001b[22m 4. The pol\u001b[24Gcy: the lot's charge, the estimate at a\u001b[64Gburn\u001b[69Gand\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77Gchoice\u001b[84Gper\u001b[88Ghour,\u001b[94Ga\u001b[96Gfixed\u001b[102Gshare\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 1536 \u001b[22m \u001b[14G  (`policy`),\u001b[28Gthe pins\u001b[37Gmoved\u001b[43Gand\u001b[47Gwhy.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m15\u001b[10G7 \u001b[13G\u001b[22m5.\u001b[16GThe fixture, on\u001b[32Gthe man\u001b[40Ged profile:\u001b[52GOre\u001b[56Gto\u001b[59GBrine\u001b[65Gwith\u001b[70Gtwo\u001b[74Gtotes\u001b[80Gof\u001b[83Gcopper\u001b[90Gand\u001b[94Gwith\u001b[99Ga\u001b[101Gfull\u001b[106Ghold,\u001b[112Gth\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[11G \u001b[13G\u001b[22me\u001b[16G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mBefore writing \"the request's two new fields\u001b[76Gck it: drop the two fields' registration\u001b[117Gfor\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
