[0.056, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mWrote\u001b[12G\u001b[1m19\u001b[15G\u001b[22mlines\u001b[21Gto\u001b[24G\u001b[1m~/projects/manifest/build/commit-w21s3b.txt\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m  1 \u001b[22mRefuel: a journey from a v\u001b[37Gnue first fills the\u001b[57Gtanks\u001b[63Gat\u001b[66Gits\u001b[70Gasks,\u001b[76GW21\u001b[80Gslice\u001b[86G3\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m  2 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m3\u001b[10G\u001b[22mA ship whose drive has a profile, leaving \u001b[53G venue,\u001b[61Gfirst refuels through the\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m4\u001b[10G\u001b[22mfl\u001b[13Ge\u001b[15G'\u001b[17G refueller, which the company installs (Travel::Fleet::SetRefueller).\u001b[87G\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 5\u001b[10G\u001b[22mIt buys the whole totes of reaction mass its tanks have room for,\u001b[76Gstraight\u001b[85G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  6 \u001b[22minto them. Where its hold has no pellets and has room, it buys a tote of them\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  7 \u001b[22minto the hold, as Load would. It then fills the magazine from the hold's\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  8 \u001b[22mpellets, a tote opened at a time. Each buy goes through Trade::MakeBuyer: a\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  9 \u001b[22mbuy at the venue's asks, best first, that rests nothing, within the account\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 10 \u001b[22mafter the fee and arrears the journey still pays. The fuel bought stays,\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m… +9 lines \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mCommitted \u001b[1m344058a\u001b[22m, running \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell comm\u001b[43Gnd…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ git -C /home/ivan/projects/manifest add data/tuning/balance.yaml docs/session-handoff.md \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bdocs/stage-4-trading-plan.md source/game/company/include/manifest/company/Company.h \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153msource/game/company/src/Company.cpp source/game/company/tests/CompanyTests.cpp \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153msource/game/content/\u001b[27Gnclude/manifest/content/…\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[14C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m37\u001b[18G 47s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m101.3k toke\u001b[39Gs)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
