001b[32Gper\u001b[36Gcommand.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe TUI ha\u001b[16G no stepped key co\u001b[35Gtrols for travel.\u001b[53G\u001b[22mIt ha\u001b[59G no\u001b[63Gtravel panel\u001b[77Gnd travels by the console line,\u001b[110Go \u001b[113Ghe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bline's two opera\u001b[22Gds a\u001b[27Ge its control.\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mconsole\u001b[17Ghas no \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mSetRefuel\u001b[39m command yet,\u001b[22m so refuelling is always o\u001b[73G there.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mA refused journey can still spend money.\u001b[46G\u001b[22mFuel\u001b[51Gbought\u001b[58Gbefore\u001b[65Gan\u001b[68G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mInsufficientFuel\u001b[85G\u001b[39mrefusal\u001b[93Gstays\u001b[99Gbought,\u001b[107Gso\u001b[110Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G\"refused, writing nothing\" rule has that one\u001b[50Gexceptio\u001b[59G,\u001b[61Gwhich I documented\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mRefuelling is two\u001b[24Gommi\u001b[29Gs.\u001b[22m It needed an imm\u001b[49Gdiate buy that Trade didn't have, so I split it from t\u001b[104Ge burn.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mMov\u001b[7Gd test hashes, each traced to its cause:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
