001b[106Gstation\u001b[114Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Geverything aboard: hull, tanks,\u001b[37Gfuel, crew and cargo. The fuel is taken from the tanks when \u001b[98Ghe journey starts. A\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bleg the tanks can't cover is refus\u001b[40Gd with a \u001b[50Gew result, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mInsufficientFuel\u001b[39m. Ships on the\u001b[92Gold tim\u001b[100G-c\u001b[103Gmpr\u001b[107Gssed drive\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bburn nothi\u001b[16Gg.\u001b[19G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mNumbers:\u001b[22m the formula\u001b[26Greproduces\u001b[37Gthe\u001b[41Gplan's\u001b[48Gfigures\u001b[56G(3,549\u001b[63Gkg\u001b[66Gand\u001b[70G1.76\u001b[75Gkg\u001b[78Gof\u001b[81Gpellets\u001b[89Gfor\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gstarter\u001b[105Gto\u001b[108GBrine\u001b[114Gat\u001b[117G1\u001b[119Gg,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G100%). At 50% thr\u001b[23Gst\u001b[26Gand 1 g the starter burns 2,097 kg.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe fuel constants\u001b[22m went into\u001b[38Gbalance\u001b[46Gfile.\u001b[52G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mConsol\u001b[12G:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtravel\u001b[39m takes \u001b[28Gwo optional operand\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
