u001b[95Gconsole\u001b[103Gline,\u001b[109Gso\u001b[112Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gline's two operands are its control.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe console has no \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mSetRefuel\u001b[39m command yet,\u001b[47G\u001b[22mso\u001b[50Grefuelling\u001b[61Gis\u001b[64Galways\u001b[71Gon\u001b[74Gthere.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mA refused journey can still spend money.\u001b[22m Fuel bo\u001b[54Gght before an \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mInsufficientFuel\u001b[85G\u001b[39mrefusal\u001b[93Gstays\u001b[99Gbought,\u001b[107Gso\u001b[110Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G\"refused, writing nothing\" rule has that\u001b[46Gon\u001b[49G exception, which I documented.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mRefuelling is two commits.\u001b[32G\u001b[22mIt needed an imm\u001b[49Gdiat\u001b[54G buy that Trade didn't have,\u001b[83Gso\u001b[86GI\u001b[88Gsplit\u001b[94Git\u001b[97Gfrom\u001b[102Gthe\u001b[106Gburn.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mMoved test hashes, each traced to its cause:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- \u001b[1mThe\u001b[10Gwo-s\u001b[15Gip trading test's pin:\u001b[22m moved onl\u001b[75Gon\u001b[78Gnumber\u001b[85Gand\u001b[89Gtwo\u001b[93Gfields.\u001b[101GWith\u001b[106Gboth\u001b[111Gtaken\u001b[117Gout,\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
